          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "ruth",
          "text": "Morning Kerry. I teach one lesson at 7:15 on Tuesdays and Thursdays; a Year 12 student with exams. It's a digital piano at moderate volume. I've done this for six years without a word. May I ask who complained?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "kerry",
          "text": "Hi Ruth, thanks for coming back to me. Unfortunately I can't share the complainant's details under our privacy policy. Quiet hours run until 8am. Thanks, Kerry"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "ruth",
          "text": "Understood. Thank you."
        }
