        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "ruth",
          "text": "Good evening. This is Ruth Danvers in 4B, directly above you. I understand you've lodged a complaint about my piano. I'd have been happy to discuss it with you directly. Ruth (4B)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "Evening. I've not complained about anything."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "I've never complained about anything in my life. Ask anyone."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "ruth",
          "text": "Someone complained about piano before 8am. Yours is the only flat below mine."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "Aye, well. It wasn't me."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "Though since you mention it. I work nights. 111 call centre. I'm in at half six and asleep by eight. Usually."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "Usually."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "ruth",
          "text": "So you didn't complain; you'd just like me to stop."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "I'd like to sleep. Different thing."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "ruth",
          "text": "My student has exams this year. I'm not moving her for a stranger who 'didn't complain'. Ruth (4B)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "Fair enough. Though if it's the scales, they're not the worst thing to fall asleep to."
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "'I've never complained about anything in my life.'"
      }
